{"step_index":249,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-08T09:54:13Z","content":"I have completed the requests:\n\n1. **Enhanced the User Interface Design**: Refined the React UI styling with a high-end dark glassmorphism theme (`index.css`), animated status indicators, active navigation pills (`Sidebar.tsx`), glowing border cards, crisp typography, and visual feedback.\n2. **Completed Academic Phase Deliverables**:\n   - **Phase 11 – Secure Development and Build Environment [6 Marks]**\n   - **Phase 12 – Secure Coding and Refactoring [4 Marks]**\n   - **Phase 13 – Containerized Development: Docker and Kubernetes [7 Marks]**\n\n---\n\n# 📦 Summary of Academic Deliverables\n\n### 1. Phase 11 – Secure Development & Build Environment [6 Marks]\n📄 **Deliverable File:** [`phase11_secure_development_environment.md`](file:///c:/Users/addal/.gemini/antigravity/brain/2ac62f09-2e24-4efd-bd40-62368c77dbf2/phase11_secure_development_environment.md)\n\n* **Git Branching Strategy**: GitFlow model (`main`, `develop`, `feature/*`, `hotfix/*`) with mandatory PR code reviews and linear history enforcement.\n* **5 Security Controls**:\n  1. *Least Privilege*: Non-root runtime execution (`appuser` UID 10001).\n  2. *Secret Management*: Decoupled environment configuration using [`.env.example`](file:///c:/Users/addal/Documents/antigravity/focused-bell/backend/.env.example) and Kubernetes Secrets.\n  3. *Dependency Control*: SHA-256 integrity hash pinning in lockfiles.\n  4. *Code Review & Branch Protection*: Blocked direct pushes to `main` and required 2 approving reviews.\n  5. *Artifact Integrity*: Cryptographic SHA-256 digests & Cosign signature tracking.\n* **Secret Non-Hardcoding Proof**: Demonstrates runtime `.env` configuration template.\n* **Static Analysis Report & Remediation**: Documents automated static vulnerability checks (`B105` hardcoded fallback secret refactored to env extraction; `B307` dynamic `eval()` replaced with safe `pac